  "Promised Meeting": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Gain $2 [Shiny Points] and enter [Idol Business] state for $3 turns.\\n[Idol Business]: Increase Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> and DMG Bonus by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Before the start of turn, gain $6 [Shiny Points].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Tossing a candy into the coffee cup～! Melting in a heartbeat～ is the sweet magic ❤ Let the foe feel～ my charming flavor!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, distribute this damage between all foes. \\nAfter using this skill in [Idol Business] mode: Double Narumi's [Shiny Points].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Time to fire the giant cream cake-! Convey this love's super technique! It's our secret code-!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK.\\nWhen [Naruru ♪ Naruru ♫] is active: Deal bonus Psy damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK for every [Shiny Points] stacks. When [Shiny Points] stacks reach $3, deal bonus Psy damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK. Also gain $5 DMG Bonus when activating this skill.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>I'm everyone's {{A}} ♪ Support and cheer for me～ Let's flood the chat! This love-powered stage ♪ Please keep your eyes on me!</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Increase Narumi's ATK based on $2 of Wonder's ATK (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK) for $4 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Psy damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "Increase DMG Bonus by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> on Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed].": "",
  "Increase DMG Bonus by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> on Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed].": "",
  "When Narumi receives an active skill from Wonder targeting herself, permanently increase ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "When Narumi receives an active skill from Wonder targeting herself, permanently increase ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "The First Stage": "",
  "Narumi has special [Shiny Points] energy. At the start of battle, Narumi has $1 [Shiny Points]. Stacks up to $2 times. Narumi can upgrade her skills based on [Shiny Points].\\nAfter deploying Narumi, Wonder will gain the special skill [{{B}} ♪ {{B}} ♫]: Grant Narumi 1 Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed] at the end of her action, also restore $3 SP to her. At the end of Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed], remove [Naruru ♪ Naruru ♫] and all [Shiny Points].\\nThis skill has a 1 turn cooldown and an initial cooldown, decrease this skill's cooldown after Wonder's non-Extra Actions.": "",
  "My Dearest Guest": "",
  "Narumi gains the special skill [Attend My Handshake Event ❤]: Grant Wonder 1 Extra Action at the end of his action. Also, restore $1 SP to him at the start of his Extra Action.\\nThis skill has a 1 turn cooldown, decrease this skill's cooldown after Narumi's non-Extra Actions.\\nNarumi can activate all buff effects from Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed] on all actions. Increase Crit DMG by $2 on Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed].": "",
  "Please Watch Me Forever": "",
  "Increase the maximum stacks of [Shiny Points] to $1. Grant Narumi $2 bonus [Shiny Points] when Wonder uses a Persona skill. \\nUpgrade skill [LIVE of LOVE ♪]: When [Shiny Points] is at $3 stacks, increase the effects from every [Shiny Points] to 1.5x.": "",
  "Exclusive Bond": "",
  "Rousing Support": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enhanced: After using Highlight, increase Narumi's Crit DMG based on $1 of Wonder's Crit DMG (up to $2 Crit DMG) for $3 turns.": "",
