  "A Smile Just for You": "",
  "After taking the Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed], do not remove [Naruru ♪ Naruru ♫] and [Shiny Points]. Then, immediately gain Extra Action [Promised Meeting] and restore $1 SP.\\nExtra Action [Promised Meeting] counts as Extra Action [Spotlight Unleashed]. At the end of Extra Action [Promised Meeting], remove [Naruru ♪ Naruru ♫] and all [Shiny Points].": "",
