  "Hound of Hades": "",
  "Deal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Increase foes' DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $2 turns (for every $4 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally increase DMG Taken by $5, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Ailment ACC, this effect from {{A}}'s other {{B}} skills do not stack), increase Fire DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> (for every $8 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally increase Fire DMG Taken by $9, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> Ailment ACC). Then, there is a <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> base chance to inflict Burn. If targets have <link\\=\"s|286\"><u>[Affinity Downgrade]</u></link>, ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $12. If targets have Fire <link\\=\"s|286\"><u>[Affinity Downgrade]</u></link>, increase Skill Damage by $13, then ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $14 more.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0> A crimson fireball, like the eye of a demon, locks firmly onto its target. Violent energy erupts in a thunderous explosion, flames consuming everything, dealing lethal damage to foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Increase foes' DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $2 turns (for every $4 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally increase DMG Taken by $5, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Ailment ACC, this effect from {{A}}'s other {{B}} skills do not stack), increase Elec DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> (for every $8 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally increase Elec DMG Taken by $9, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> Ailment ACC). Then, there is a <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> base chance to inflict Shock. If targets have <link\\=\"s|286\"><u>[Affinity Downgrade]</u></link>, ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $12. If targets have Elec <link\\=\"s|286\"><u>[Affinity Downgrade]</u></link>, increase Skill Damage by $13, then ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $14 more.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Dazzling red lightning strikes down like a blade, sparks flying everywhere. Each strike overwhelmingly engulfs all foes, causing them to lose the will to resist.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Increase foes' DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $2 turns (for every $4 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally increase DMG Taken by $5, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Ailment ACC, this effect from {{A}}'s other {{B}} skills do not stack), increase Ice DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> (for every $8 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally increase Ice DMG Taken by $9, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> Ailment ACC). Then, there is a <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> base chance to inflict Freeze. If targets have <link\\=\"s|286\"><u>[Affinity Downgrade]</u></link>, ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $12. If targets have Ice <link\\=\"s|286\"><u>[Affinity Downgrade]</u></link>, increase Skill Damage by $13, then ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $14 more.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Interwoven ripples of ice sweep across the enemy ranks with relentless force, dealing devastating damage to foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Hound of Hades: Use condition: When Koromaru has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, inflict [Soul Hunt]. Decrease target's DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $7 turns (for every $4 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally decrease DEF by $5, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Ailment ACC).\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Curse damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Restore $8 Theurgy Energy that can exceed the maximum limit. Permanently decrease all foes' DEF by $9, then gain the ability: When Koromaru is present, after a new foe appears, automatically inflict them with the permanent $10 DEF Down effect.": "",
  "Use condition: When Koromaru has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, inflict [Soul Hunt]. Decrease target's DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $7 turns (for every $4 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally decrease DEF by $5, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Ailment ACC).": "",
  "Use condition: When Koromaru has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Curse damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $2 of ATK, inflict [Soul Hunt]. Decrease target's DEF by $3 for $7 turns (for every $4 of {{A}}'s Ailment ACC, additionally decrease DEF by $5, up to a maximum of $6 Ailment ACC).": "",
