  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Specific Conditions]</color>": "",
  "When selecting a S.E.E.S. member as the [Owner], they can use the Assist Skill menu to command {{A}} to use {{B}} skills. They can use other Assist Skills as normal. When not selecting a S.E.E.S. member as the [Owner], at the start of their turn, {{A}} will automatically use {{B}} skills based on their attribute. After selecting the [Owner], {{A}} will no longer have his own action, but can still activate Koromaru's start/end of turn effects at the [Owner]'s start/end of turn.": "",
  "City's Top Dog": "",
  "Before the first character's action in battle, Koromaru can manually select 1 ally as the [Owner] and can use [Hound's Hunt] based on <link\\=\"s|287\"><u>[Specific Conditions]</u></link>. After selecting the [Owner], Koromaru will automatically use Assist Skill. \\nKoromaru's Theurgy can inflict targets with [Soul Hunt]. Inflict targets with Fire/Elec/Ice <link\\=\"s|286\"><u>[Affinity Downgrade]</u></link> when using certain Persona skills to attack foes with [Soul Hunt], then grant all allies [Loyal Howl]: Increase ATK by $1, DMG Dealt by $2, and Theurgy DMG Amp by $3. Lasts for $4 turns.": "",
  "Woof!": "",
  "After [Hound's Hunt] or after Koromaru manually uses a Persona skill, permanently increase all allies' Crit DMG by $1. Stacks up to $2 times.\\nWhen the [Owner] takes damage that would KO them, survive the attack with $3 HP and restore $4 Max HP to them. This effect activates once per battle.": "",
